{
  "document_path": "docs/02-operational-semantics.md",
  "units": [
    {
      "unit_id": "u0001",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 1,
      "source_text": "# Operational Semantics\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0002",
      "line_start": 3,
      "line_end": 5,
      "source_text": "**Status:** Normative  \n**Version:** R1  \n**Scope:** Formal operational semantics of the Chron-LLM runtime.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0003",
      "line_start": 7,
      "line_end": 7,
      "source_text": "# 1. Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0004",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 9,
      "source_text": "This specification defines the operational semantics of the deterministic Chron-LLM runtime.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0005",
      "line_start": 11,
      "line_end": 11,
      "source_text": "It specifies the observable behavior of the core runtime operations while remaining independent of implementation details.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0006",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "source_text": "This document defines **what** each operation means, not **how** it is implemented.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0007",
      "line_start": 15,
      "line_end": 15,
      "source_text": "# 2. Commit\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0008",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 17,
      "source_text": "## Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0009",
      "line_start": 19,
      "line_end": 19,
      "source_text": "Commit is the sole operation permitted to mutate Canonical.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0010",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 21,
      "source_text": "## Input\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0011",
      "line_start": 23,
      "line_end": 26,
      "source_text": "```\nEvent\nCanonical\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0012",
      "line_start": 28,
      "line_end": 28,
      "source_text": "## Output\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0013",
      "line_start": 30,
      "line_end": 32,
      "source_text": "```\nCanonical'\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0014",
      "line_start": 34,
      "line_end": 34,
      "source_text": "## Observable Effects\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0015",
      "line_start": 36,
      "line_end": 39,
      "source_text": "- Event is appended to History.\n- Lamport Clock advances.\n- MemoryRef is updated when required.\n- Canonical becomes the new authoritative state.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0016",
      "line_start": 41,
      "line_end": 41,
      "source_text": "## Preconditions\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0017",
      "line_start": 43,
      "line_end": 45,
      "source_text": "- The originating Candidate has passed Validation.\n- PolicyRouter has produced a `commit-request`.\n\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0018",
      "line_start": 46,
      "line_end": 46,
      "source_text": "## Postconditions\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0019",
      "line_start": 48,
      "line_end": 49,
      "source_text": "- Canonical reflects the committed Event.\n- Previous Canonical state remains replayable.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0020",
      "line_start": 51,
      "line_end": 51,
      "source_text": "## Failure Semantics\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0021",
      "line_start": 53,
      "line_end": 53,
      "source_text": "Commit SHALL either\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0022",
      "line_start": 55,
      "line_end": 56,
      "source_text": "- complete atomically, or\n- leave Canonical unchanged.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0023",
      "line_start": 58,
      "line_end": 58,
      "source_text": "Partial commits are prohibited.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0024",
      "line_start": 60,
      "line_end": 60,
      "source_text": "# 3. Replay\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0025",
      "line_start": 62,
      "line_end": 62,
      "source_text": "## Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0026",
      "line_start": 64,
      "line_end": 64,
      "source_text": "Replay reconstructs the execution context required for deterministic runtime execution from Canonical.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0027",
      "line_start": 66,
      "line_end": 66,
      "source_text": "## Input\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0028",
      "line_start": 68,
      "line_end": 70,
      "source_text": "```\nCanonical\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0029",
      "line_start": 72,
      "line_end": 72,
      "source_text": "## Output\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0030",
      "line_start": 74,
      "line_end": 78,
      "source_text": "```\nProjection\nGraph\nSummary\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0031",
      "line_start": 80,
      "line_end": 80,
      "source_text": "## Observable Behavior\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0032",
      "line_start": 82,
      "line_end": 82,
      "source_text": "Replay SHALL\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0033",
      "line_start": 84,
      "line_end": 87,
      "source_text": "- reconstruct the execution context from Canonical\n- be deterministic\n- be reproducible\n- be side-effect-free\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0034",
      "line_start": 89,
      "line_end": 89,
      "source_text": "Replay SHALL NOT mutate Canonical.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0035",
      "line_start": 91,
      "line_end": 91,
      "source_text": "# 4. Derive\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0036",
      "line_start": 93,
      "line_end": 93,
      "source_text": "## Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0037",
      "line_start": 95,
      "line_end": 95,
      "source_text": "Derive computes the complete non-authoritative runtime representation from Canonical.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0038",
      "line_start": 97,
      "line_end": 97,
      "source_text": "## Input\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0039",
      "line_start": 99,
      "line_end": 101,
      "source_text": "```\nCanonical\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0040",
      "line_start": 103,
      "line_end": 103,
      "source_text": "## Output\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0041",
      "line_start": 105,
      "line_end": 107,
      "source_text": "```\nDerived\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0042",
      "line_start": 109,
      "line_end": 109,
      "source_text": "Derived MAY include\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0043",
      "line_start": 111,
      "line_end": 114,
      "source_text": "- Projection\n- Graph\n- Summary\n- Analysis\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0044",
      "line_start": 116,
      "line_end": 116,
      "source_text": "## Observable Behavior\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0045",
      "line_start": 118,
      "line_end": 118,
      "source_text": "Derive SHALL\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0046",
      "line_start": 120,
      "line_end": 122,
      "source_text": "- preserve determinism\n- produce identical outputs for identical Canonical\n- perform no state mutation\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0047",
      "line_start": 124,
      "line_end": 124,
      "source_text": "Replay reconstructs the execution context used by the Runtime.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0048",
      "line_start": 126,
      "line_end": 126,
      "source_text": "Derive produces the complete Derived representation.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0049",
      "line_start": 128,
      "line_end": 128,
      "source_text": "# 5. Validation\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0050",
      "line_start": 130,
      "line_end": 130,
      "source_text": "## Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0051",
      "line_start": 132,
      "line_end": 132,
      "source_text": "Validation collects objective facts regarding a Candidate.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0052",
      "line_start": 134,
      "line_end": 134,
      "source_text": "## Input\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0053",
      "line_start": 136,
      "line_end": 140,
      "source_text": "```\nCandidate\nCanonical\nConfig\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0054",
      "line_start": 142,
      "line_end": 142,
      "source_text": "## Output\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0055",
      "line_start": 144,
      "line_end": 146,
      "source_text": "```\nValidationReport\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0056",
      "line_start": 148,
      "line_end": 148,
      "source_text": "## Observable Behavior\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0057",
      "line_start": 150,
      "line_end": 150,
      "source_text": "Validation SHALL\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0058",
      "line_start": 152,
      "line_end": 155,
      "source_text": "- be deterministic\n- be side-effect-free\n- perform no routing\n- perform no state mutation\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0059",
      "line_start": 157,
      "line_end": 157,
      "source_text": "Interpretation of ValidationReport is delegated exclusively to PolicyRouter.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0060",
      "line_start": 159,
      "line_end": 159,
      "source_text": "# 6. Candidate Lifecycle\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0061",
      "line_start": 161,
      "line_end": 161,
      "source_text": "A Candidate progresses through the following lifecycle.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0062",
      "line_start": 163,
      "line_end": 192,
      "source_text": "```\nGenerated\n        │\n        ▼\nValidated\n        │\n        ▼\nPolicyRouter\n        │\n        ▼\nRuntimeRequest\n        │\n        ├────────────► commit-request\n        │                  │\n        │                  ▼\n        │               Commit\n        │\n        ├────────────► reject-request\n        │\n        ├────────────► defer-request\n        │                  │\n        │                  ▼\n        │          DeferredQueue\n        │\n        ├────────────► retry-request\n        │\n        ├────────────► retry-penalty-request\n        │\n        └────────────► abort-request\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0063",
      "line_start": 194,
      "line_end": 194,
      "source_text": "Only `commit-request` may produce authoritative state mutation.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0064",
      "line_start": 196,
      "line_end": 196,
      "source_text": "# 7. Recovery\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0065",
      "line_start": 198,
      "line_end": 198,
      "source_text": "## Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0066",
      "line_start": 200,
      "line_end": 200,
      "source_text": "Recover reconstructs execution after abnormal termination or worldline branching.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0067",
      "line_start": 202,
      "line_end": 202,
      "source_text": "## Input\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0068",
      "line_start": 204,
      "line_end": 207,
      "source_text": "```\nCanonical\nMemoryRef\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0069",
      "line_start": 209,
      "line_end": 209,
      "source_text": "## Output\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0070",
      "line_start": 211,
      "line_end": 213,
      "source_text": "```\nRecovered Context\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0071",
      "line_start": 215,
      "line_end": 215,
      "source_text": "## Observable Behavior\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0072",
      "line_start": 217,
      "line_end": 217,
      "source_text": "Recovery MAY\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0073",
      "line_start": 219,
      "line_end": 223,
      "source_text": "- destroy runtime caches\n- reconstruct Prefill\n- resume execution\n- reconstruct Derived\n- reconstruct Working\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0074",
      "line_start": 225,
      "line_end": 225,
      "source_text": "Recovery SHALL NOT modify Canonical.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0075",
      "line_start": 227,
      "line_end": 227,
      "source_text": "Canonical mutation remains exclusively the responsibility of Commit.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0076",
      "line_start": 229,
      "line_end": 229,
      "source_text": "# 8. Worldline Branching\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0077",
      "line_start": 231,
      "line_end": 231,
      "source_text": "## Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0078",
      "line_start": 233,
      "line_end": 233,
      "source_text": "Branch execution into a new causal worldline.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0079",
      "line_start": 235,
      "line_end": 235,
      "source_text": "## Input\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0080",
      "line_start": 237,
      "line_end": 240,
      "source_text": "```\nCanonical\nBranch Condition\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0081",
      "line_start": 242,
      "line_end": 242,
      "source_text": "## Output\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0082",
      "line_start": 244,
      "line_end": 246,
      "source_text": "```\nNew causal-id\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0083",
      "line_start": 248,
      "line_end": 248,
      "source_text": "## Observable Behavior\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0084",
      "line_start": 250,
      "line_end": 250,
      "source_text": "Branching MAY\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0085",
      "line_start": 252,
      "line_end": 256,
      "source_text": "- destroy KV cache\n- reconstruct Prefill\n- reconstruct Derived\n- reconstruct Working\n- traverse causal Graph\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0086",
      "line_start": 258,
      "line_end": 258,
      "source_text": "Branching SHALL NOT mutate Canonical.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0087",
      "line_start": 260,
      "line_end": 260,
      "source_text": "The new causal-id becomes authoritative only after Commit.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0088",
      "line_start": 262,
      "line_end": 262,
      "source_text": "Canonical mutation remains exclusively the responsibility of Commit.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0089",
      "line_start": 264,
      "line_end": 264,
      "source_text": "# 9. State Transitions\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0090",
      "line_start": 266,
      "line_end": 266,
      "source_text": "The deterministic runtime transition function is\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0091",
      "line_start": 268,
      "line_end": 273,
      "source_text": "```\nKernelState × RuntimeRequest\n        │\n        ▼\nKernelState'\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0092",
      "line_start": 275,
      "line_end": 275,
      "source_text": "Only the Kernel performs state transitions.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0093",
      "line_start": 277,
      "line_end": 277,
      "source_text": "Validation and PolicyRouter are pure functions.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0094",
      "line_start": 279,
      "line_end": 279,
      "source_text": "# 10. Determinism\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0095",
      "line_start": 281,
      "line_end": 281,
      "source_text": "The following operations SHALL be deterministic:\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0096",
      "line_start": 283,
      "line_end": 287,
      "source_text": "- Replay\n- Derive\n- Validation\n- PolicyRouter (RuntimeRequest generation)\n- Kernel State Transition\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0097",
      "line_start": 289,
      "line_end": 289,
      "source_text": "The Backend (LLM generation) is explicitly non-deterministic.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0098",
      "line_start": 291,
      "line_end": 291,
      "source_text": "# 11. Constitutional Constraints\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0099",
      "line_start": 293,
      "line_end": 293,
      "source_text": "This specification conforms to the Constitution.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0100",
      "line_start": 295,
      "line_end": 295,
      "source_text": "In particular:\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0101",
      "line_start": 297,
      "line_end": 302,
      "source_text": "- Only Commit may mutate Canonical.\n- Derived is non-authoritative.\n- Replay is deterministic.\n- Validation collects facts only.\n- PolicyRouter performs interpretation only.\n- Kernel performs state transitions only."
    }
  ]
}
